   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Inter-Agency Project (UNIAP) on Human trafficking in the Greater Mekong Sub-region (Thailand, Cambodia, Burma, Vietnam, Lao PDR, and Yunnan Province of China), Phase II.UNIAP brings together six governments, 13 UN agencies and NGOs. It was established in 2000 as an overarching mechanism to combat trafficking in women and children and implem. progr in prevention, repatr., rehab. and law enforcement.</narrative>
